# REG.RU SSL guard

If the task touches **DNS**, **REG.RU hosting panel**, **Russia proxy**, **public API host** (`harmonizer.zamkovoi.yoga`), or files matched by this rule — **read first**:

`docs/04_workspace/reg_ru_harmonizer_ssl_guard.md`

Also read it when the user asks in natural language to move DNS, attach the domain to Vercel, change nameservers, add site aliases, or change redirects — even if no matched file is open yet.

Before executing a **STOP** operation from that doc: warn the user explicitly; do not apply infra changes silently.